  ///
  /// Not part of the chunk, for the reason `ChunkGroundOverlaySMSG` gives: `ChunkPatchEncoding` has exactly one
  /// value, `CHUNK_PATCH_ENCODING_REMOVAL_V1`, and a client derives a patched voxel's material locally - so no
